    "enUS": {
      "description": "<You quickly remove the pendant from the crate and replace the lid.>",
      "dialogue": {
        "4d3fb761d0313c776326": "Have you learned anything useful, $n?",
        "e9d283b3e0e5670922c6": "Maps and this... pendant, hm? Interesting.$b$bIt is obvious that the Dalaran wizards are interested in Ambermill for some purpose, but still, their aim is hidden to me.$b$bPerhaps Dalar will know something of their use."
      },
      "summary": "Bring the strange pendant to Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.",
      "title": "Maps and Runes",
